"Olorn-art'h, Olorn Mom to Stuart, is one of the Primary's six spouses and a former votary."
"She and Veln were the Primary's first marriage contract."
"She is a potter who refines rare soil into vessels and the stuff of knights' rings and wands."
"Her son is Kofa; she gave Alden a study-aid earring and offered to find him a tutor."
